    "detailed_description": "On a bright morning, you - a raccoon - go for a walk in a village by the river. You listen to the villager's conversations and perform small tasks to get the villager's life going.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are several dens in tree trunks across the village. By entering them you can descend into the Cave of Time. Here you see the memories in villagers' past as flowers in the river of time. You can open these memory flowers with the memory leaves earned from the village.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe memory tells a story from the villagers' past. Some or all of the characters in this memory are the villagers that he has encountered in the village. After the memory is played out, you match those characters with the villagers. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game proceeds with exploration of the Village and the Cave of time, with the goal of uncovering the life stories of all the villagers - navigating their present, past (and future)",
    "about_the_game": "On a bright morning, you - a raccoon - go for a walk in a village by the river. You listen to the villager's conversations and perform small tasks to get the villager's life going.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are several dens in tree trunks across the village. By entering them you can descend into the Cave of Time. Here you see the memories in villagers' past as flowers in the river of time. You can open these memory flowers with the memory leaves earned from the village.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe memory tells a story from the villagers' past. Some or all of the characters in this memory are the villagers that he has encountered in the village. After the memory is played out, you match those characters with the villagers. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game proceeds with exploration of the Village and the Cave of time, with the goal of uncovering the life stories of all the villagers - navigating their present, past (and future)",
    "short_description": "In the hills by the river is a small village of handful souls. A raccoon walks through them and their past lives discovering their joys and sorrows. Spend your time in an idyllic rustic environment unlocking the villagers' memories and solving environmental puzzles.",
